Open Vanilla 0055: Herald quests straight through (no side trips) and rides his mount

On Open Vanilla spells are learned on level-up (OpenVanilla.AutoLearn), every character has a mount
from level 1, and quest XP is raised, so the fastest leveling is quest after quest. For Herald (the
self-bot only; random bots unchanged, playerbot/HeraldBrain.cpp):
- no trips to class or profession trainers, the mount trainer or vendor, cities, the auction house,
  the mailbox, bosses, guild meetings or for sightseeing ("generic rpg"); no stopping at trainers he
  passes; gathering trips only with the Gather goal; reagent vendors (arrows, shot) and selling and
  repairs stay;
- the mount: the bot AI already rides when it travels if the character has a mount, as long as its
  "mount" behaviour is on; the Herald addon and Autopilot now keep "+mount" in his orders.
Applies after 0020.

